lass=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"99c92f3457aacd12\" href=\"?note=99c92f3457aacd12\" title=\"27-df-literal\">27-df-literal</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"T_L\\coloneqq\\left\\{\\left(a,\\prod_{\\ell\\in L}\\ell(a)\\right)\\mid a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\right\\},\\qquad\\prod_{\\ell\\in\\emptyset}\\ell(a)\\coloneqq1.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[T_L\\coloneqq\\left\\{\\left(a,\\prod_{\\ell\\in L}\\ell(a)\\right)\\mid a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\right\\},\\qquad\\prod_{\\ell\\in\\emptyset}\\ell(a)\\coloneqq1.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Term}_n\\coloneqq\\{T_L\\mid L\\in\\mathrm{ConsLit}_n\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Term}_n\\coloneqq\\{T_L\\mid L\\in\\mathrm{ConsLit}_n\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>显式图给出唯一全函数。由于文字集一致，每项均非零；不同一致文字集给出不同函数（可在不同文字所在坐标选见证），故后续取 Lits 单值。空项为常 1。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-literal","status":"resolved","id":"99c92f3457aacd12","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-literal]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-literal","status":"resolved","id":"99c92f3457aacd12","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$L\\in\\mathrm{ConsLit}_n$；文字及一致文字集见 [[27-df-literal]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"L\\in\\mathrm{ConsLit}_n","display":false},{"tex":"T_L\\coloneqq\\left\\{\\left(a,\\prod_{\\ell\\in L}\\ell(a)\\